      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DYNAMITE DANNI (4) has been racing well from wider barriers. Raced parked and won in style two back at Newcastle then led and fought well to go under narrowly at this circuit and distance last week. Should push forward again from the lower draw and could be hard to stop. FEARFUL (3) drew a wider gate last start and was solid enough when beaten 8 metres into fifth at this circuit and distance last week. From a far better starting position he can play a major role. WARRAWEES SHOUT (6) draws wider but comes off a good effort last time out when third at Goulburn. Can feature again along with KING COREY (9) who draws deep but added to a series of top-four finishes with a respectable third at his most recent appearance at Penrith.",
